olor":16752736,"ms":300},{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":null,"text":"The hay catches in a rush of orange and is gone in moments."},{"c":"set","sw":"hay_burnt","v":true}]}]},{"id":10,"x":27,"y":4,"realm":"both","pages":[{"cond":{"nsw":"hay_burnt"},"g":{"obj":"hay"},"trigger":"action","list":[{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":null,"text":"A bale of dry hay is wedged into the corner. Something glints behind it. A little flame would clear the way."}],"ft":"burnable","fieldList":[{"c":"se","name":"fire"},{"c":"flash","color":16752736,"ms":300},{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":null,"text":"The hay catches in a rush of orange and is gone in moments."},{"c":"set","sw":"hay_burnt","v":true}]}]},{"id":11,"x":26,"y":6,"realm":"near","pages":[{"cond":{"nsw":"daigo_joined"},"g":{"sheet":"smith","dir":"down"},"trigger":"action","list":[{"c":"msg","face":"smith","name":"Daigo","text":"Whoa! A Lantern? You\u2019re Sachi\u2019s girl, aren\u2019t you? Mio! You \u2014 how did you get across? The ledge crumbled behind me. I\u2019ve been stuck here two days!"},{"c":"msg","face":"mio","name":"Mio","text":"The Far Shore. There\u2019s a spirit bridge. And Kaze, here, found a good snack. Kind of."},{"c":"msg","face":"kaze","name":"Kaze","text":"Excuse me. I am not a snack."},{"c":"msg","face":"smith","name":"Daigo","text":"Is that a talking fox? Never mind. Listen: I came for the old bell clapper. The legend says the Well Spirit keeps the Shrine Key, and the key\u2019s tied to the clapper."},{"c":"msg","face":"smith","name":"Daigo","text":"But the spirit\u2019s just\u2026 sad. Really sad. I couldn\u2019t fight it. Hammer doesn\u2019t help when someone\u2019s crying."},{"c":"msg","face":"mio","name":"Mio","text":"Then we won\u2019t fight it. Not at first."},{"c":"msg","face":"smith","name":"Daigo","text":"Right. Right! I\u2019ll head back and get the forge lit. A smith owes a debt to a Lantern-bearer who pulls him out of a hole. When the Bell rings, come find me."},{"c":"msg","face":"daigo","name":"Daigo","text":"(He picks up his hammer and scrambles up the rope ladder.)"},{"c":"me","name":"secret"},{"c":"set","sw":"daigo_joined","v":true},{"c":"quest","id":"main","stage":4,"done":false,"quiet":false},{"c":"erase"}]}]},{"id":12,"x":25,"y":15,"realm":"both","pages":[{"cond":{"nsw":"key_got"},"g":null,"trigger":"touch","list":[{"c":"checkpoint","boss":true},{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":null,"text":"A cold mist curls through the chamber. Dark water collects into a shape: a spirit with a lantern for a heart."},{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":"Ido-no-Kami","text":"\u2026It was here. I kept it. Nobody came. Nobody drew water. Nobody sang to me."},{"c":"msg","face":"mio","name":"Mio","text":"It\u2019s grieving. Kaze, Daigo, don\u2019t strike unless I say. We can Parley with it. Soothe, Remember, and then Send it on."},{"c":"msg","face":"kaze","name":"Kaze","text":"It isn\u2019t angry, Mio. It\u2019s just\u2026 waiting. Like I did."},{"c":"msg","face":"mio","name":"Mio","text":"I\u2019m sorry nobody came. I\u2019m here now. Would you like to hear the festival song?"},{"c":"flash","color":13629183,"ms":500},{"c":"se","name":"magic2"},{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":null,"text":"Mio hums the old lantern song. The Lantern warms in her hands, and the dark water stills."},{"c":"msg","face":null,"name":"Ido-no-Kami","text":"The old lantern\u2026 still burns somewhere. Thank you. Take the key. Ring the Bell for me."},{"c":"me","name":"fanfare"},{"c":"item","id":"shrine_key"},{"c":"set","sw":"key_got","v":true},{"c":"quest","id":"main","stage":5,"done":false,"quiet":false},{"c":"msg","face":"kaze","name":"Kaze","text":"Gentle beats loud. Remember that when we meet the Bell-Keeper."},{"c":"tutorial","id":"exit","text":"Stairs near the south chamber lead back up to the village.","ms":5000}],"through":true}]},{"id":13,"x":20,"y":15,"realm":"both","pages":[{"cond":null,"g":null,"trigger":"touch","list":[{"c":"transfer","map":1,"x":5,"y":24,"dir":"up","se":"grass"}],"through":true}]}